 truetype='false' familyid='20'/></run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='AdminAccess' authors='true' names='true' protected='true'><text
>[Administrator]</text></item>
<item name='DnsProviderConfigName'><text>bunny.net</text></item>
<item name='ProviderName'><text>BunnyWay d.o.o</text></item>
<item name='Website'><text>https://www.bunny.net</text></item>
<item name='DocumentationURL'><text>https://docs.bunny.net/api-reference/core/dns-zone/</text></item>
<item name='Version'><text>1.0</text></item>
<item name='Author'><text>Shaun Ewing</text></item>
<item name='ReferenceURL'><text/></item>
<item name='StatusFormula'><text>@if (ret_AddStatus = 201; 200; 400)</text></item>
<item name='cfg_URL'><text>https://api.bunny.net/</text></item>
<item name='ReqLookupUrlFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='ReqLookupHeaderFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='ReqLookupPostDataFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='ReqLookupCustomFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='ReqQryAddUrlFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='ReqQryAddHeaderFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='ReqQryAddPostDataFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='ReqAddUrlFormula'><text>cfg_URL + "/dnszone/" + cfg_DnsZone + "/records"</text></item>
<item name='ReqAddHeaderFormula'><text>("AccessKey: " + cfg_AuthKey ) : ( "Content-Type: application/json" )</text></item>
<item name='ReqAddPostDataFormula'><text>txtName := @If(@Ends(param_DnsTxtName; "." + param_RegisteredDomain); @Left(param_DnsTxtName; "." + param_RegisteredDomain); param_DnsTxtName);<break
/>'{"Name":"' + txtName + '","Type":3,"Ttl":60,"Value": "' + param_DnsTxtValue +'","Comment":"Created by Domino CertMgr"}'</text></item>
<item name='ReqQryDelUrlFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='ReqQryDelHeaderFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='ReqQryDelPostDataFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='ReqDelUrlFormula'><text>ID_TXT:= @Text(retJSON_Add.Id); @if (ID_TXT= ""; ""; cfg_URL + "/dnszone/" + cfg_DnsZone + "/records/" + ID_TXT)</text></item>
<item name='ReqDelHeaderFormula'><text>("AccessKey: " + cfg_AuthKey ) : ( "Content-Type: application/json" )</text></item>
<item name='ReqDelPostDataFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='CommandAddFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='CommandDelFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='CommandEnvFormula'><text/></item>
<item name='AgentDatabase'><text/></item>
<item name='AgentAddName'><text/></item>
